<contentList>
  <content contentuid="h27c5ff2fgd70dg4e71ga8dag4c73148e6fcb" version="1">苦痛连枷是受劳薇塔祝福的武器，能够对敌人释放神圣愤怒。然而强大的力量是有代价的，使用者必须付出痛苦才能赢得劳薇塔的祝福。
连枷可以用附赠动作对自己造成伤害，然后对区域内敌人施以惩戒，伤害随角色等级成比例。</content>
  <content contentuid="h7985721cg9edcg4f19gae2eg48afb32970ee" version="1">苦痛连枷</content>
  <content contentuid="hcd4dd757g77cag49beg968fgec5334c1d997" version="1">这把剑是由魔索布莱城的卓尔精灵铸造的，会让接触到的任何东西中毒，但持有者可以免受毒害。</content>
  <content contentuid="h2ed2b143g8696g4b10gaaadg63abaf5c36bf" version="1">毒液</content>
  <content contentuid="h69edb82bgd94ag431ag9e8egca2532cceb04" version="1">通过将化学物质和魔法混合物注入刀刃中，迅速使敌人丧失行动能力。</content>
  <content contentuid="h47610189g5aa5g4fc7gaca0g3fef656d5b7f" version="1">致残匕首</content>
  <content contentuid="h830a3855g6353g490fg93e9g4972ef433d95" version="1">一把神奇的弩，射程比普通弩更远，威力也更强。双持弩时置于主手以增加射程。</content>
  <content contentuid="h61fe2181g3befg4205g820bg528b19c5dd0d" version="1">狙击弩</content>
  <content contentuid="h2f898868g5517g49bfg84acg709f42341b53" version="1">一个能够将魔法注入所射出弩箭的魔法弩。</content>
  <content contentuid="h21451838geb2fg493fgb7cdgf3ce8ef989f4" version="1">魔法弩</content>
  <content contentuid="h6a44a60agb6d5g4376g954ag282e3ab28765" version="1">降低敌人造成伤害的魔法盾。
提供物理伤害抗性和被动保护。</content>
  <content contentuid="h55984cd6gd666g477dg8ffcgad02cdbdfc83" version="1">阻挡之盾</content>
  <content contentuid="h1a0532c6g6c3ag4516g94d8g0f1f07e6f844" version="1">可疑的包裹</content>
  <content contentuid="h73f90216g71aag46ecg919eg573811ccff6d" version="1">连发弩</content>
  <content contentuid="hf66ea2bag1606g4b0cg9c87g8ce6158ccfa5" version="1">这把重型弩可以装载额外的弩箭，释放毁灭性的齐射，但会出现逆火的风险。还可以过度拉紧以增加射程和伤害。在战斗前可以额外装填弩箭或过载以节省时间。</content>
  <content contentuid="he89d30bfg9805g4005ga28ege355e1cb7456" version="1">龙之刃</content>
  <content contentuid="h655022a9g5933g406bga09ag1cb25292e1b5" version="1">这把武器的刀刃异常轻巧，但炙热得无法触摸，似乎是由龙焰所锻造。幸运的是，使用者获得了很大程度上的火焰伤害保护。这把剑与一头红色巨龙和它的小弟缔结了契约，在需要时可以召唤它们。</content>
  <content contentuid="hefe2da47g9b4fg40fdga900ga3e4c1ab6d03" version="1">饥饿之锤</content>
  <content contentuid="h8bbf8c86gb8f9g442ega4acg929cc45a995d" version="1">这把被诅咒的锤子渴望暴力，驱使你去满足它的欲望。</content>
  <content contentuid="h44978df8g1338g42b6ga5d1g6f6de5aa2ae9" version="1">佩戴这枚戒指会让人充满能量。</content>
  <content contentuid="h6f8f8c94g94e5g456bg96eag1160011e7513" version="1">力量之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="h7163c6d1gb2ffg42a0gbfa5g2fbef86e258b" version="1">末日</content>
  <content contentuid="hac183187g3d25g47f5g8c34gf5dfe201a57a" version="1">这把斧头散发着黯蚀能量，能对那些不幸被击中的人造成毁灭性的打击。
概率使敌人麻痹。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd13a1311g81bfg41bcgb640ge442984803f4" version="1">寒冰巨剑</content>
  <content contentuid="hf31cf50egd979g49a7g8914g6f5f8d140972" version="1">这把巨剑从周围抽取热量，寒冷触碰到的一切物体。其中一部分热量被传递给使用者，保护他们免受寒冷，并防止使用者在周围冻结的地面上滑倒。
概率对敌人造成冻僵。</content>
  <content contentuid="hebd0ca34gffd9g4125g9d08g277e1888bf9e" version="1">这个盾牌闪烁着特别的能量，能够弹开投射物。</content>
  <content contentuid="had856bc9gb3dbg4692gbaccg5d80ae89ed4d" version="1">偏斜护盾</content>
  <content contentuid="h40f310bfga9eag4e2dgafb2gbbda7055f0a5" version="1">这根法杖能释放出治愈能量波，治愈它触碰到的任何事物。但法杖的力量也会使目标精疲力竭，使其进入睡眠状态。
法杖造成的攻击会治疗目标。</content>
  <content contentuid="hfba19e38g54a2g45fbgab53gccca58709beb" version="1">沉睡之杖</content>
  <content contentuid="h47e78c13gfe4dg49a5gb448g667ece0dd387" version="1">临时背包</content>
  <content contentuid="he5a01f23g01e3g4c0fg94eeg28a62ae7f5fc" version="1">这个背包似乎并不属于这个领域，正在慢慢地消失返回原来的位置，但里面的东西似乎很稳定。</content>  
  <content contentuid="h6abb7e57ga0d0g4607gbb1bg42085489c8fd" version="1">弩袋</content>
  <content contentuid="h6afa41b4g5926g41e6ga3f7ga3584478e5a7" version="1">这个袋子装有一些非常致命的远程武器。</content>
  <content contentuid="hbbbbdd2ag8fe4g479agabcagaf81fb744cb9" version="1">武器袋</content>
  <content contentuid="h5c37fc93g0732g428dg9016g02170532a527" version="1">这个袋子装有各种近战武器。</content> 
  <content contentuid="ha7c5ed97ga89fg4a25g8411g1079e6c9c5aa" version="1">护甲袋</content>
  <content contentuid="h5c312613g25ddg4770gb01ag4edeb3f147c8" version="1">这个相当沉重的袋子里装满了华丽的盔甲。</content>
  <content contentuid="h6dbf415eg8f98g45dagbf41gf8f89f0b6e40" version="1">当你看着这枚戒指上的宝石时，其中有仿佛试图逃离的火焰在跃动。或许紧握住它能释放这股能量。</content>
  <content contentuid="hd62e5540g163fg4a95gb9cag4660ba613356" version="1">火焰之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="he334c657gf590g41c0gb6fagfbe3704f8215" version="1">当你看着这枚戒指上的宝石时，其中有仿佛试图逃离的霜冻在跃动。或许紧握住它能释放这股能量。</content>
  <content contentuid="hb2b9bb20gb303g404bg897eg97d9c03be65e" version="1">冰霜之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="640ecace42414c6ea9b810ccdf5ff3d2" version="1">当你看着这枚戒指上的宝石时，其中有仿佛试图逃离的火焰在跃动。或许紧握住它能释放这股能量。</content>
  <content contentuid="8320c56665444329b4d940566c11add7" version="1">强化火焰之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="09f05206ee90486bade43eff33d1a5b4" version="1">当你看着这枚戒指上的宝石时，其中有仿佛试图逃离的霜冻在跃动。或许紧握住它能释放这股能量。</content>
  <content contentuid="524b30daaa4340019f38928b2d3040a1" version="1">强化冰霜之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="h972be674ga19eg43b7ga928g3b3ab6d62a74" version="1">荆棘治愈之冠</content>
  <content contentuid="h9c14c263g834cg4918g9a13gbdb1baa29844" version="1">这个头环上有朝外延伸的尖锐荆棘，但你注意到在某些情况下它们可以扭转向内。</content>
  <content contentuid="h948a7104gc50dg4af7gacd1gea13dcc6890a" version="1">这套护甲已被莎尔祝福，仔细观察可以看到阴影在其中流动。</content>
  <content contentuid="h08a6549dg5a5eg443dga7e2gc6a18b70a01b" version="1">莎尔护甲</content>
  <content contentuid="0ab87731-efa2-4a15-8db1-71f096ae078c" version="1">这把战戟充满力量，每次短休后可以释放毁灭性的雷鸣。</content>
  <content contentuid="67eff79a-5e6e-4f44-b459-d75178e7ad10" version="1">雷鸣战戟</content>
  <content contentuid="b9ef77a5-8d37-4b86-bd9a-f9eb94d17897" version="1">这副手套用魔法增强了你的力量。</content>
  <content contentuid="40ca8594-3f83-49c8-9a11-7eecee54a707" version="1">力量手套</content>
  <content contentuid="b066455bfbc949a68d7c6961cfdcc0aa" version="1">劳薇塔的恩赐</content>
  <content contentuid="01cb410f827a4de094660f6a95dd7aae" version="1">已展现出对劳薇塔的忠诚</content>
  <content contentuid="1e2927a2811c4bc389f51971271e9788" version="1">过载锁定</content>
  <content contentuid="bb3648238a78485a84c76222be3cd650" version="1">弩已经准备完毕，准备释放过载射击</content>
  <content contentuid="23e05c61fea2448b9be3d2fd3d449c91" version="1">黑暗契约</content>
  <content contentuid="7d59d3bce3e744af82ae0bfc18c09b89" version="1">与厄瑞斯努签订契约，你可以选择通过哪种屠杀方式来获得奖励。</content> 
  <content contentuid="c7d8543fb79748b7a15db060dc732568" version="1">撕咬</content>
  <content contentuid="a17dc6dbe50341d6a77a8aa2ab9f2f67" version="1">咬向附近的敌人，并恢复生命值</content>
  <content contentuid="b3e0518caed349a1a8946172ddb5b88e" version="1">沉睡之杖治疗</content>
  <content contentuid="d205bf93cbdf4eda8e449e50386b9b44" version="1">引导沉睡之杖的能量来治疗</content>
  <content contentuid="5dda6f9f517c41fb838f6e846cd9a8bc" version="1">沉睡之杖复活</content>
  <content contentuid="f6a1a639d0ef4b11a3989f891a8db111" version="1">利用沉睡之杖内部的力量复活一名倒下的盟友</content>
  <content contentuid="175a0972b329409281801bd3b72df72b" version="1">额外装填</content>
  <content contentuid="cc4a800c9e5644019a6c65d2f71efe10" version="1">弩发出令人担忧的吱吱声，但已准备好发射</content>
  <content contentuid="8fc161fb0e2246eb8a8b846fb66c919b" version="1">锤之赠与</content>
  <content contentuid="833d0246946f4625acff91a4dce2df1f" version="1">满足锤子的渴望会赋予你更强大的力量</content>
  <content contentuid="f0a424564bb84cdeb448cbf160933896" version="1">寒冰巨剑</content>
  <content contentuid="5d9ed505d0c04c6ea0139ecb673f1980" version="1">极端的寒冷使移动变得困难</content>
  <content contentuid="70bcdecbd8784e12bad81de20919f08a" version="1">火焰之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="42d7fc4f750e4e569bac9ee83f50d5b1" version="1">火焰在你的内心肆虐</content>
  <content contentuid="ed76926f04fe4b8cbd56ba5580bcf5b5" version="1">火焰之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="1671e0e8754b4a798c3aa3e9836a2fdc" version="1">火焰在燃烧</content>
  <content contentuid="51d0329ddd2744569d3c3d8bbfe6faed" version="1">冰霜之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="f604ee8f588641a48968f600878a3464" version="1">寒冷在你的内心肆虐</content>
  <content contentuid="b2bd0c636dd34c439ce178eb1283ce87" version="1">冰霜之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="44133bb43a644021b3ffcbc5ccfb84f7" version="1">如此寒冷....</content>
  <content contentuid="1ca905d07c3f4b86b3fff924c444c8ba" version="1">荆棘治愈之冠的治愈</content>
  <content contentuid="3c4d3c1b2d87437eba88d5a241a7ce80" version="1">缓慢恢复生命。</content>
  <content contentuid="9ddf82deabed4e368a601a801b519a60" version="1">荆棘治愈之冠的治愈</content>
  <content contentuid="23ec199180684698adbc9c35c8371a1c" version="1">你将荆棘转向内侧...</content>
  <content contentuid="bf3580346a6347f98b0a5931d224040c" version="1">雷鸣战戟</content>
  <content contentuid="b66bd299e1a24434a342f4623964c467" version="1">以巨大的冲击波释放刃内的能量。</content>
  <content contentuid="6b586c2481144493b82ec3b51d007842" version="1">龙息</content>
  <content contentuid="ad86e1fe7f1145bfadd1d0b9e535f32b" version="1">喷吐一大片龙息火焰。</content>
  <content contentuid="73fb866002f3412fa09b965bd26c2079" version="1">挥扫</content>
  <content contentuid="2ca7c745e9264aea8d3f8d75fa216cc9" version="1">用爪子猛力挥扫前方。</content>
  <content contentuid="4e9cdd55c5ab4eec84bd84b9bfcfcc2f" version="1">召唤巨龙</content>
  <content contentuid="927645a7de29422a868c2d3ef82f7993" version="1">召唤一头红色巨龙来协助你。</content>
  <content contentuid="a8bf88ed9d9940aaa7d21d8359d7f836" version="1">激活火焰之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="8765a2af9e2542cab5acf3f6276412fa" version="1">激活你的火焰之戒来焚烧你的敌人。</content>
  <content contentuid="395b54ff38d6497d89204a3f9d1f05a4" version="1">激活冰霜之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="8608dbb6b44846dc8dffdedbf68d7bcc" version="1">激活你的戒指来向你的敌人释放死亡冰霜。</content>
  <content contentuid="d4a2ac8c7447459390b3e7122eea355b" version="1">荆棘治愈之冠的治愈</content>
  <content contentuid="5a6ce858e53643709943c03123c28716" version="1">随着时间的推移慢慢恢复生命。
敌人对你的任何攻击行为百分百额外造成1d4穿刺伤害。</content>
  <content contentuid="23ff214562d5426785a15316fe1b1a66" version="1">劳薇塔的恩赐</content>
  <content contentuid="8898048a0361401ba043e18956b6ba79" version="1">向劳薇塔证明你值得她的祝福，献出1d6生命值。</content>
  <content contentuid="d978478dc1124b3a802a78ee865251aa" version="1">劳薇塔的惩罚</content>
  <content contentuid="285b4b6f75db49559ecf2050edab2e8a" version="1">已证明自己者可以向他们的敌人释放劳薇塔的愤怒。
造成1d6+1d6*角色等级的伤害，如果惩罚豁免检定失败，伤害会减半</content>
  <content contentuid="1450b51eb4754b1ab2bce426c16ab630" version="1">连发弩过载</content>
  <content contentuid="69c87e421f8345b18100ff3a473cdb03" version="1">过度拧紧发射装置可以射得更远、打击更猛、更具穿透。此过程消耗行动，最好在进入战斗之前执行。</content>
  <content contentuid="67ef7d608f5440d5ab6dd5e0c2c796e8" version="1">连发弩连射</content>
  <content contentuid="d141b00c67d046caad939e7fbe3f783e" version="1">将额外的弩箭装入弩中以准备一次大齐射。 但这有可能导致逆火。</content>
  <content contentuid="afc7efc25ba54c5d9744c1c37c05d7bf" version="1">魔法射击</content>
  <content contentuid="f23193db7df34457aeac0997177a2fe0" version="1">当你射击时这把传奇的弩可以创造出神奇的箭。</content>
  <content contentuid="76aceba076e04158921d023ad3311ea0" version="1">过载射击</content>
  <content contentuid="e27aac3c71e74990a2948d7c4b95ea56" version="1">进行毁灭性的远程射击，可击中多个敌人。</content>
  <content contentuid="e596bcfb10f546b2872f6e141ccd20bb" version="1">连发射击</content>
  <content contentuid="8b075485b196487a925064f1228112ac" version="1">发射连续的弩箭来击中敌人。</content>
  <content contentuid="0b0388ede3ae481fa33e03fd9054c642" version="1">集中龙息</content>
  <content contentuid="7f6a9721c9fe429495e27a2fb21d095c" version="1">喷吐一团龙息，形成极其灼热的地面。</content>
  <content contentuid="3971dcb094954a698673c4cbf9946959" version="1">灼热冲击</content>
  <content contentuid="fb909531b59e4e4b97afe48ca0e60c8e" version="1">喷出多股火焰。</content>
  <content contentuid="dd97092912a04fb0b4fb385852fcf9cc" version="1">饥饿之锤</content>
  <content contentuid="51a40328ed1947638744fe520f9052b1" version="1">这把锤子渴望鲜血,它对愤怒和暴力的渴望充斥着你。</content>
  <content contentuid="23eb422c495d4f39a967aa151ccd220c" version="1">莎尔护甲</content>
  <content contentuid="7dc4dce44f12449ea80918f469af0333" version="1">黑暗流过你的身体。
获得黑暗视觉（或增强）。</content>
  <content contentuid="75923a9aad3c4651a1905d018130bffe" version="1">荆棘治愈之冠</content>
  <content contentuid="e1ccf8afbd224f0bbde263b239094ca1" version="1">锋利的荆棘环绕着你的头。</content>
  <content contentuid="83a5bdcae290463d86c55c73767465e8" version="1">荆棘治愈之冠</content>
  <content contentuid="ad18bbc9a19c4c1ca424e0c258d37852" version="1">锋利的荆棘环绕着你的头。</content>
  <content contentuid="39579f9ebd014233b655ff8ccf81c8d0" version="1">火焰之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="289c7d76993949da87c1f6c9112b776a" version="1">火焰在你的体内燃烧。</content>
  <content contentuid="c152de6c3dd946838363c179c47d59b6" version="1">冰霜之戒</content>
  <content contentuid="08fc1374ff8b45789faab85a1d32e95a" version="1">冰霜充斥着你的血管。</content>
  <content contentuid="c1954b6612be42e88371b9cdb4a5ac74" version="1">召唤熔岩元素</content>
  <content contentuid="b7e227feb3df43d8b8dbf1915a7a5124" version="1">召唤一个熔岩元素为你而战。</content>
  <content contentuid="ed7df05e20314dacbd3187667882166d" version="1">能力戒指</content>
  <content contentuid="e4df611e3ed84877b815157a57fa3e9c" version="1">这是一枚蕴含非凡力量的戒指。</content>
  <content contentuid="f4ddfc394d7c4fa99b47cf36dc93bf6b" version="1">切割弯刀</content>
  <content contentuid="29f08f418a774ece911994e0d9d51d81" version="1">这把刀能够攻击目标的弱点，造成毁灭性的打击。
可使用附赠动作使敌人弱点暴露，造成暴击。</content>
  <content contentuid="9561e4e833c6498daa00818fcba58737" version="1">弱点探查</content>
  <content contentuid="175c7398295443a9b50e24e28354b6d2" version="1">用弯刀探查目标，暴露他们的弱点。</content> 
  <content contentuid="2b3e4d352ca4493a99f58d259e0279fc" version="1">弱点暴露</content>
